  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accelerating Recovery for Human Security in Ukraine with Urgent Response to Intensified Attacks through &#x201c;Co-Creation&#x201d; Cooperation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to catalyse urgent recovery and strengthen resilience in response to the surge in deaths, destruction, displacement by recent intensified mass-attacks and cumulative suffering caused by the war in Ukraine. It seeks to promote Human Security by implementing immediate and coordinated responses to the interconnected and multidimensional threats that the country is currently facing, while strategically leveraging Japan&#x2019;s experience, technologies, and expertise to address challenges</narrative>
  </description>
